the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/11/04/morgan-stanley-says-it-is-among-the-first-banks-to-put-u-s-stocks-and-treasuries-on-a-blockchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Morgan Stanley says it is among the first banks to tokenize real world assets</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
